{"4221600": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Pripyat 0", "steam_appid": 4221600, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pripyat 0 is an anomaly game taking place right after the Chernobyl reactor 4 meltdown. You've found yourself stuck cycling through The Zone, trying to reach safety, whilst reality crumbles around you. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pripyat 0 takes between 45 and 120 minutes to complete.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As radiation is raining down around you, the world is rapidly mutating, and you have gotten stuck in a time loop. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If everything looks normal, head right. If there is something out of place, head left. Complete 8 correct loops in a row, and perhaps you can live another day...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4221600/extras/47e1f87b4ff8cc8d76e57371c749c7e5.poster.avif?t=1779183821\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4221600/extras/47e1f87b4ff8cc8d76e57371c749c7e5.webm?t=1779183821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4221600/extras/47e1f87b4ff8cc8d76e57371c749c7e5.mp4?t=1779183821\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with stalkers, explore the remains of what once was normal life, and uncover dark secrets. Just don't hang around for too long...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4221600/extras/2f9460338440b3664fca514e7c39e131.poster.avif?t=1779183821\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4221600/extras/2f9460338440b3664fca514e7c39e131.webm?t=1779183821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4221600/extras/2f9460338440b3664fca514e7c39e131.mp4?t=1779183821\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 unique endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 32 anomalies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voice-acted (English / Russian)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controller support</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4221600/extras/8c68ae0d9dda7462822594ed056295d3.poster.avif?t=1779183821\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4221600/extras/8c68ae0d9dda7462822594ed056295d3.webm?t=1779183821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4221600/extras/8c68ae0d9dda7462822594ed056295d3.mp4?t=1779183821\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pripyat 0 is an anomaly game taking place right after the Chernobyl reactor 4 meltdown. You've found yourself stuck cycling through The Zone, trying to reach safety, whilst reality crumbles around you. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pripyat 0 takes between 45 and 120 minutes to complete.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As radiation is raining down around you, the world is rapidly mutating, and you have gotten stuck in a time loop. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If everything looks normal, head right. If there is something out of place, head left. Complete 8 correct loops in a row, and perhaps you can live another day...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4221600/extras/47e1f87b4ff8cc8d76e57371c749c7e5.poster.avif?t=1779183821\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4221600/extras/47e1f87b4ff8cc8d76e57371c749c7e5.webm?t=1779183821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4221600/extras/47e1f87b4ff8cc8d76e57371c749c7e5.mp4?t=1779183821\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with stalkers, explore the remains of what once was normal life, and uncover dark secrets. Just don't hang around for too long...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4221600/extras/2f9460338440b3664fca514e7c39e131.poster.avif?t=1779183821\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4221600/extras/2f9460338440b3664fca514e7c39e131.webm?t=1779183821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4221600/extras/2f9460338440b3664fca514e7c39e131.mp4?t=1779183821\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 unique endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 32 anomalies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voice-acted (English / Russian)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controller support</p></li></ul><